  "details": "Administrators now have a \"Banned Users\" page on the website for ban management.\n\nI am requesting additional information for bans that are important for group management.\n\nIt is ESSENTIAL that my community moderators can record the REASON they banned someone.\n\nHere's a list:\n\n1. When a moderator bans a user, allow them to supply a reason. (Text box).\n\n2. Record which moderator banned the user, and the datetime, visible in the banned users list next to the reason. This information is currently only in the action logs.\n\n3. Allow us to add bans by Player ID (even if that person is not in the group).\n\n3. Ban history (a list of user's previous bans related information).",
